 *
 * Start menu with title, board size input (default 20, min 10, viewport-capped),
 * session high-score display, and "Start Game" button.
 * "Press any key to start" overlay after clicking Start Game.
 * Real-time score display during play.
 * Game-over screen showing final score, session high-score, and "Play Again".
 * Session high-score resets on page reload (no localStorage).
 */

